# BioSpur UWB full-system freeze point.
#
# Created: 2026-05-12
# Purpose:
#   Record the currently used Anchor / Master_Anchor / Tag / Master_Tag build
#   set so the system can be restored to this exact working point later.
#
# Important:
#   Do not modify, rebuild, flash, or OTA Anchor / Master_Anchor from this
#   freeze point unless the user explicitly requests Anchor / Master_Anchor
#   image work.

